WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:24.102
"Kip, wake up!" called Bird.

2
00:00:24.103 --> 00:00:28.674
"I want to tell you something!"

3
00:00:28.675 --> 00:00:32.524
Kip jumped out of bed.

4
00:00:32.525 --> 00:00:36.567
He shot out of his hole.

5
00:00:36.568 --> 00:00:40.159
"What is it, Bird?" he asked.

6
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:43.702
"Goose is going to visit!" said Bird.

7
00:00:43.703 --> 00:00:50.715
"She will be here this afternoon."

8
00:00:50.716 --> 00:00:53.307
"Yay!" said Kip.

9
00:00:53.308 --> 00:00:55.727
"I like Goose a lot!"

10
00:00:55.728 --> 00:01:03.666
Kip went back into his hole.

11
00:01:03.667 --> 00:01:06.773
He found a pencil and paper.

12
00:01:06.774 --> 00:01:10.360
"We'll need fun things to do," thought Kip.

13
00:01:10.361 --> 00:01:13.884
"First we'll go to the playground.

14
00:01:13.885 --> 00:01:17.886
Then we will go to the aquarium."

15
00:01:17.887 --> 00:01:23.688
Kip wrote down his ideas.

16
00:01:23.689 --> 00:01:27.676
Bird was in her nest.

17
00:01:27.677 --> 00:01:31.123
She found a pencil and paper.

18
00:01:31.124 --> 00:01:35.751
"We'll need fun things to do," thought Bird.

19
00:01:35.752 --> 00:01:39.052
"First we'll go to the beach.

20
00:01:39.053 --> 00:01:44.358
Then we will go to the boardwalk."

21
00:01:44.359 --> 00:01:50.206
Bird wrote down her ideas.

22
00:01:50.207 --> 00:01:56.642
She smiled. "We will have so much fun!"
